permalink: /content/celebrity/
lang: en
faq:
  - question: "What celebrity content is available?"
    answer: "We cover all major celebrity categories: red carpet events, film premieres, music and entertainment, award shows, fashion week appearances, candid and paparazzi photography, and exclusive editorial portraits. Coverage includes Latin American, US, and international celebrities."
  - question: "How current is the celebrity photography?"
    answer: "Our celebrity archive is updated daily. Breaking celebrity news photography is available within hours of an event through our wire agency partners. Established account holders can download immediately."
  - question: "Do you cover Latin American celebrities specifically?"
    answer: "Yes. Latin American celebrity and entertainment photography is a core strength of our library. We have dedicated coverage of the region's biggest stars across music, telenovela, sport, film, and social media, as well as coverage of their international activities."
  - question: "Can I get exclusive content for my publication?"
    answer: "Exclusive territory licenses are available for selected content. Contact our team to discuss your needs. We can arrange first-day exclusives or territory exclusives depending on what's available and your publication's requirements."
